"""Greenpoint Veterinary Hospital, 145 Nassau Ave -- card for a friend's
Tidbyt. make_frames.py writes the frames for one moment (time of day,
holiday, weather) into this file at every push; pixlet only plays them.

Open: the logo with a walking paw trail, then the dog and cat scene.
Closed: just the sleeping scene (STRIP is empty).
"""

